need no billboard, don’t need no shout,"},{"s":49.32,"e":51.96,"text":"Everybody knows what his house is about,"},{"s":52.02,"e":54.82,"text":"From the tailgate shine to the front-yard crowd,"},{"s":54.9,"e":57.7,"text":"Frank’s carryin’ town with that pickup truck clout."},{"s":63.64,"e":66.34,"text":"He rolls down Main with a coffee cup grin,"},{"s":66.78,"e":69.14,"text":"Old Ford rumblin’ like a Sunday hymn,"},{"s":69.22,"e":72.02,"text":"Dog in the back and a flag on the rack,"},{"s":72.06,"e":74.88,"text":"Every head turns when ol’ Frank drives past."},{"s":74.94,"e":77.9,"text":"He ain’t chasin’ likes, he ain’t chasin’ gold,"},{"s":77.92,"e":80.46,"text":"Just flyin’ every flag like a story told,"},{"s":80.84,"e":83.3,"text":"Neighbors come by just to point and stare,"},{"s":83.4,"e":86.32,"text":"Sayin’, “That man’s got a whole parade out there.”"},{"s":86.74,"e":89.44,"text":"Frank’s got flags, Frank’s got fame,"},{"s":89.58,"e":92.06,"text":"Every little breeze knows his name,"},{"s":92.56,"e":94.86,"text":"Chrome on the bumper, mud on the tires,"},{"s":94.96,"e":97.68,"text":"Whole neighborhood lifted a little bit higher."},{"s":97.72,"e":100.58,"text":"He don’t need no billboard, don’t need no shout,"},{"s":100.72,"e":103.36,"text":"Everybody knows what his house is about,"},{"s":103.42,"e":106.22,"text":"From the tailgate shine to the front-yard crowd,"},{"s":106.34,"e":109.1,"text":"Frank’s carryin’ town with that pickup truck clout."},{"s":120.52,"e":123.34,"text":"When the sun goes down and the porch lights glow,"},{"s":123.42,"e":126.18,"text":"Those colors still dance in a moonlit row,"},{"s":126.28,"e":129.06,"text":"Some folks got statues, some folks got gates,"},{"s":129.28,"e":134.4,"text":"Frank’s got 300 flags and a Chevrolet."},{"s":135.06,"e":137.66,"text":"Frank’s got flags, Frank’s got fame,"},{"s":137.74,"e":140.58,"text":"Every backroad breeze knows his name,"},{"s":140.74,"e":143.36,"text":"Chrome on the bumper, stars in the sky,"},{"s":143.92,"e":146.28,"text":"Pickup truck clout rollin’ country-wide."},{"s":146.5,"e":149.04,"text":"Raise one high, let the whole block shout,"},{"s":149.12,"e":151.9,"text":"There ain’t no neighbor we brag more about,"},{"s":151.92,"e":154.76,"text":"From the flagpole forest to the driveway crowd,"},{"s":154.86,"e":157.62,"text":"Frank’s carryin’ us all with that pickup truck clout."}],"duration":172.48,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-06T19:43:40.410Z","stats":{"whisperWords":368,"polishedWords":353,"matched":334,"matchRate":0.946}}